  <p>Scores, impact percentages, and revenue opportunities are prioritization scenarios—not promises, forecasts, or guarantees. Merchants are responsible for validating recommendations, product facts, accessibility, and legal claims before publishing changes.</p>
  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Do not use generated copy to create fake reviews, false urgency, unsupported health or performance claims, deceptive pricing, or content that violates Shopify policies or applicable law.</p>
  <h2>Plans and billing</h2>
  <p>Starter, Growth, and Pro are recurring 30-day subscriptions billed through Shopify. First-time subscribers receive a 7-day trial. Each plan includes the audit allowance shown when the merchant approves the charge; failed audits do not use an allowance.</p>
  <p>Plan changes require a new approval in Shopify and may be prorated under Shopify’s billing rules. A merchant can stop future charges by uninstalling the app. Except where required by law, fees already charged are non-refundable. Agency pricing is not available until multi-store support launches.</p>
